WEBVTT

01:01.640 --> 01:06.060
<i><b>Partners</b></i>

01:26.080 --> 01:27.560
<b>Blade...</b>

01:28.920 --> 01:29.710
<b>Hey!</b>

01:31.960 --> 01:34.850
<b>Hey, wake up!</b>

01:35.380 --> 01:36.840
<b>Dammit...</b>

01:37.680 --> 01:38.390
<b>This...</b>

01:39.260 --> 01:40.640
<b>I came to bring it back.</b>

01:43.060 --> 01:45.840
<b>I promised, remember?</b>

01:49.110 --> 01:50.500
<b>You awake?</b>

01:52.480 --> 01:53.530
<b>Hang on...</b>

01:54.830 --> 01:57.490
<b>I'll get you out of there...</b>

01:58.160 --> 02:01.240
<b>Ma... ko... to...</b>

02:22.890 --> 02:25.520
<b>No!</b>

03:04.810 --> 03:06.220
<b>Magnificent...</b>

03:07.390 --> 03:10.940
<b>Now this is the Daywalker blood
that I've been searching for.</b>

03:11.650 --> 03:13.360
<b>Keep it up!</b>

03:13.360 --> 03:15.160
<b>Drain every last drop from him!</b>

03:17.360 --> 03:19.420
<b>Everything is going as I had planned!</b>

03:20.650 --> 03:22.570
<b>Makoto...!</b>

03:32.670 --> 03:34.300
<b>Don't think...</b>

03:35.210 --> 03:37.800
<b>that you're gonna get
everything you hoped for!</b>

03:47.970 --> 03:50.180
<b>Don't interfere, girl.</b>

04:03.110 --> 04:05.240
<b>You've served your purpose.</b>

04:09.910 --> 04:10.900
<b>Die.</b>

04:16.590 --> 04:18.340
<b>Razor, get back!</b>

04:34.980 --> 04:35.850
<b>Eric!</b>

04:36.620 --> 04:38.440
<b>You were in here?</b>

04:45.990 --> 04:46.870
<b>Miss!</b>

04:49.450 --> 04:50.430
<b>Are you alright?</b>

04:55.620 --> 04:57.330
<b>This is terrible...</b>

05:31.870 --> 05:34.160
<b>Eric, are you alright?</b>

05:34.160 --> 05:35.830
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

05:58.690 --> 05:59.560
<b>Eric!</b>

06:00.930 --> 06:02.460
<b>We need to get out of here!</b>

06:04.650 --> 06:05.400
<b>Hurry!</b>

06:40.520 --> 06:41.480
<b>Lord Frost!</b>

06:45.480 --> 06:46.610
<b>Get us in the air!</b>

07:30.900 --> 07:31.820
<b>Makoto...</b>

07:34.370 --> 07:35.080
<b>Makoto!</b>

07:38.250 --> 07:39.040
<b>Say something.</b>

07:43.380 --> 07:44.500
<b>Makoto...</b>

07:46.420 --> 07:48.300
<b>Blade...</b>

07:48.300 --> 07:49.840
<b>are you okay?</b>

07:50.550 --> 07:51.680
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:51.680 --> 07:54.050
<b>I survived, thanks to you.</b>

07:54.680 --> 07:56.180
<b>I see...</b>

07:56.180 --> 07:57.470
<b>that's good.</b>

07:59.350 --> 08:01.100
<b>Where's your mom's knife?</b>

08:03.150 --> 08:06.110
<b>Don't worry about it!</b>

08:08.440 --> 08:09.610
<b>But...</b>

08:18.740 --> 08:21.430
<b>Thank you, Razor...</b>

08:24.040 --> 08:26.040
<b>We had a lot of fun together, huh?</b>

08:28.170 --> 08:29.800
<b>Thanks to you...</b>

08:30.920 --> 08:33.630
<b>I managed to make it this far.</b>

08:36.090 --> 08:41.020
<b>Now, go on back to Noah...</b>

08:44.850 --> 08:46.080
<b>Razor...</b>

08:47.310 --> 08:48.400
<b>You have to go.</b>

08:58.160 --> 08:59.030
<b>Gramps...</b>

09:00.290 --> 09:02.120
<b>Take care of Razor...</b>

09:03.210 --> 09:06.750
<b>make sure he gets
something nice to eat.</b>

09:07.880 --> 09:08.700
<b>I will.</b>

09:09.130 --> 09:10.340
<b>Leave it to me.</b>

09:14.010 --> 09:18.260
<b>I brought it back to you,
just like I promised...</b>

09:19.560 --> 09:20.390
<b>Makoto...</b>

09:24.390 --> 09:25.480
<b>Stop it...</b>

09:25.480 --> 09:26.560
<b>you're embarrassing me.</b>

09:28.440 --> 09:29.440
<b>But...</b>

09:30.230 --> 09:31.590
<b>it doesn't really bother me.</b>

09:36.030 --> 09:39.870
<b>Our meeting might have been terrible...</b>

09:42.120 --> 09:47.370
<b>But I don't blame you for
killing my Dad anymore...</b>

09:53.510 --> 09:56.470
<b>You had better bring Frost down.</b>

09:58.220 --> 09:59.720
<b>Promise me...</b>

10:01.930 --> 10:02.640
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:08.350 --> 10:13.280
<b>It keeps getting colder...</b>

10:15.150 --> 10:17.490
<b>Do it, now.</b>

10:21.410 --> 10:26.250
<b>I don't wanna turn to dust
the way they do...</b>

10:28.920 --> 10:30.040
<b>I...</b>

10:31.670 --> 10:33.550
<b>want to die, as a human.</b>

10:37.090 --> 10:38.720
<b>You...</b>

10:38.720 --> 10:40.390
<b>understand, right?</b>

10:50.060 --> 10:51.540
<b>Noah.</b>

11:00.410 --> 11:01.950
<b>What is it?</b>

11:02.990 --> 11:04.660
<b>Makoto...</b>

11:04.660 --> 11:06.040
<b>I...</b>

11:07.870 --> 11:10.540
<b>While I'm still human...</b>

11:11.580 --> 11:12.460
<b>please.</b>

11:13.420 --> 11:15.210
<b>Do it.</b>

11:17.760 --> 11:20.380
<b>You're my partner, right?</b>

11:22.340 --> 11:24.010
<b>Hurry!</b>

11:24.010 --> 11:25.560
<b>Do it!</b>

11:45.200 --> 11:46.080
<b>Makoto...</b>

11:47.160 --> 11:50.540
<b>you were the best partner
I could've asked for.</b>

11:54.790 --> 11:56.040
<b>Thank you...</b>

11:56.960 --> 11:58.000
<b>Eric.</b>

12:39.380 --> 12:44.840
Armoroad, the vampire city

14:02.550 --> 14:08.010
<b><i>I've finally combined the blood of
the Daywalker with my own,</i></b>

14:08.010 --> 14:10.850
<b><i>to create the ultimate strain.</i></b>

14:33.290 --> 14:34.950
<b>Now, my children...</b>

14:34.950 --> 14:37.290
<b>survive this trial.</b>

14:38.120 --> 14:39.580
<b>Overcome death...</b>

14:39.580 --> 14:42.290
<b>and open the gate to a new evolution!</b>

14:50.970 --> 14:52.180
<b>Survive...</b>

14:52.180 --> 14:54.100
<b>my children.</b>

14:54.100 --> 14:56.020
<b><i>Survive this ascent,</i></b>

14:56.020 --> 14:59.230
<b><i>and you'll become the foundation for
Existence's new world order!</i></b>

15:52.860 --> 15:55.990
<b>I know where Deacon Frost is.</b>

15:57.290 --> 16:01.500
<b>At the border between Thailand,
Myanmar, and Laos...</b>

16:01.500 --> 16:05.090
<b>there's a place that was called
the Golden Triangle,</b>

16:05.090 --> 16:08.420
<b>where drug syndicates used
to produce their product.</b>

16:10.470 --> 16:16.550
<b>They've built a vampire city,
called Armoroad there.</b>

16:17.640 --> 16:19.020
<b>Armoroad...</b>

16:20.480 --> 16:21.810
<b>Right.</b>

16:21.810 --> 16:23.900
<b>It's Existence's home base.</b>

16:25.310 --> 16:26.110
<b>What shall we do?</b>

16:26.940 --> 16:28.940
<b>They number in the thousands.</b>

16:30.110 --> 16:31.700
<b>Still willing to go?</b>

16:38.950 --> 16:40.370
<b>What's this?</b>

16:40.370 --> 16:45.920
<b>A shaman in Sumatra gave this
holy water to Makoto.</b>

16:46.290 --> 16:47.380
<b>It kills them.</b>

16:51.380 --> 16:52.590
<b>I see.</b>

16:53.340 --> 16:54.510
<b>I'll look after this.</b>

17:37.510 --> 17:38.890
<b>It's a success.</b>

17:44.180 --> 17:46.480
<b>Now it's my turn...</b>

17:51.860 --> 17:55.200
<b>So the Pureblooded fools have come?</b>

18:11.420 --> 18:13.000
<b>This place...</b>

18:13.000 --> 18:15.840
<b>it's truly worthy of being called a city.</b>

18:17.840 --> 18:19.970
<b>Listen you mongrel hordes!</b>

18:19.970 --> 18:23.680
<b>Feast your eyes upon
our Pureblood strength!</b>

18:26.710 --> 18:29.710
<b>We've come for Deacon Frost's head!</b>

18:49.080 --> 18:50.710
<b>Abominable...</b>

18:50.710 --> 18:53.550
<b>so these are the creatures
Frost's created?</b>

18:55.020 --> 18:56.350
<b>Don't falter!</b>

18:58.800 --> 19:01.930
<b>My beloved children of the night...</b>

19:02.600 --> 19:05.180
<b>wreak havoc to your heart's content!</b>

19:08.890 --> 19:13.230
<b>To think that the Purebloods would be
stupid enough to come to Armoroad,</b>

19:13.230 --> 19:16.070
<b>when they know nothing...</b>

19:32.540 --> 19:33.330
<b>Unbelievable.</b>

19:34.590 --> 19:36.800
<b>What's the meaning of this?</b>

19:36.800 --> 19:38.630
<b>Such insolence...</b>

19:38.630 --> 19:40.680
<b>Those filthy mongrels...</b>

19:54.310 --> 19:55.500
<b>Hold the line!</b>

19:55.500 --> 19:56.520
<b>Fight!</b>

20:01.570 --> 20:02.700
<b>Who's there?</b>

20:24.720 --> 20:25.800
<b>It can't be...</b>

20:25.800 --> 20:26.930
<b>that's Blade!</b>

20:27.560 --> 20:31.560
<b>Who would have thought Blade would
appear at Existence's home base?</b>

20:31.560 --> 20:32.560
<b>Curse you!</b>

20:50.250 --> 20:51.160
<b>It's Blade!</b>

20:51.540 --> 20:53.040
<b>Blade's here!</b>

21:17.520 --> 21:19.320
<b>Let's go, Makoto.</b>

23:02.590 --> 23:03.250
<b>Kikyo!</b>

23:04.170 --> 23:05.710
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

23:08.510 --> 23:13.140
<b>Why not re-shape the world with me?</b>

23:13.510 --> 23:14.220
<b>What!?</b>

23:14.470 --> 23:15.930
<b>That reminds me...</b>

23:15.930 --> 23:17.640
<b>whatever happened to that girl?</b>

23:17.640 --> 23:19.560
<b>Deacon Frost!</b>

23:25.230 --> 23:31.070
<i><b>On the Dark Side</b></i>

23:25.980 --> 23:29.990
<b>Next time on Blade: On the Dark Side.</b>
